  <section className="section faq-block" aria-labelledby="category-faq-title"><div className="container"><div className="section-head"><div><p className="eyebrow">FAQs</p><h2 className="section-head__title" id="category-faq-title">Questions about Skin Care</h2></div></div><div className="acc"><details className="acc__item"><summary>What Skin Care products do you stock?</summary><p>Iconic Beauty &amp; Baby lists 267 Skin Care products across Body Lotion &amp; Cream, Cleansers &amp; Face Wash, Creams &amp; Moisturisers, Eye Care, including lines from Aichun, Alps Goodness, Avène, Banana Boat. Prices in this category run from Rs 100 to Rs 5,900, and every product page shows the size, SKU and stock.</p></details><details className="acc__item"><summary>How do I choose the right Skin Care product?</summary><p>Cleansers, moisturisers, serums, sun care and treatments for a simple routine. Filter by type, brand and price, and check the pack for ingredients and directions. Use the type, brand and price filters to narrow the skin care range, then open a product page for the size and stock.</p></details><details className="acc__item"><summary>Are Skin Care prices current?</summary><p>Yes. The 267 Skin Care products here use prices from the current stock report, and 3 carry a launch offer with the regular price struck through. Because Skin Care stock moves with each report, check the product page before you order.</p></details><details className="acc__item"><summary>Do you deliver Skin Care products across Sri Lanka?</summary><p>Yes. Skin Care orders leave our Colombo 02 store and are delivered across Sri Lanka. Sample delivery rates for Skin Care appear at demo checkout, and confirmed rates plus dispatch times will be published before the store goes live. Check the delivery page before you order Skin Care online.</p></details></div></div></section>
